losed at $16.85, its first close above the base high of $16.63. Volume that day was 6.0M shares, 1.12x the prior 10-day average of 5.3M. It never committed. The best close afterward was $17.25, within 5% of the level, and the chart ends at $14.84.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that never resolved. Price chopped around the level without committing either way. Sitting it out, or getting out flat, was a fine read."}}